14-CONC#,#Economics#,#HASS Concentration in Economics#,#Concentration in Economics

A concentration in Economics requires three subjects. Not available to Economics (14-1) or Mathematical Economics (14-2) primary majors.

intro_econ, "Introductory Economics" := 14.01, 14.02, 14.03, 14.04, 14.05

intermediate_econ, "Intermediate Economics" := 14.06, 14.08, 14.12, 14.13, 14.16, 14.18, 14.20, 14.26, 14.27, 14.35, 14.36, 14.41, 14.42, 14.43, 14.44

advanced_econ, "Advanced Economics" := 14.121, 14.122, 14.123, 14.124, 14.125, 14.126, 14.127, 14.129, 14.130, 14.131, 14.137, 14.147, 14.15, 14.150, 14.160, 14.161, 14.163, 14.164, 14.19, 14.200, 14.270, 14.260, 14.281, 14.271, 14.272, 14.273, 14.282, 14.283, 14.284, 14.300, 14.310, 14.320, 14.38, 14.380, 14.381, 14.382, 14.383, 14.384, 14.385, 14.386, 14.387, 14.388, 14.39, 14.390, 14.410, 14.416, 14.420, 14.440, 14.441, 14.442, 14.444, 14.448, 14.449

